# Audio, features, and model weights are large and often license-encumbered.
# Nothing under these is committed - see MODELS_AND_DATASETS.md for why.
# The folder patterns are anchored to the repo root. Unanchored, `audio/` also matched the
# src/workbench/audio/ package, which silently kept its source out of git (FIX-1).
/audio/
/models/
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.aiff
*.ogg
*.onnx
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.zarr/

# Working material
experiments/**/out/
scratch/

# AI Token Optimizer extension artifacts (generated per machine on workspace open).
# The extension rewrites these itself, so they are machine-local, not repo canon:
# CLAUDE.md and .codex/ are its instruction outputs, .cavemanrc its verbosity config,
# .aicache/ the semantic answer cache and telemetry, .codegraph/ the index database.
# Matches the block in ewc3labs-hq. Added 2026-09-21.
CLAUDE.md
.codex/
.cavemanrc
.aicache/
.codegraph/

# The extension also writes MCP servers with absolute local paths into .vscode/settings.json,
# and this repo is public. Ignored until LabsHQ rules on tracking a redacted copy instead.
.vscode/settings.json
